    skos:definition "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:employmentRole is functional: an employment bears exactly one canonical role at a time, so a change of role is a new employment record or a standpoint-indexed claim rather than a second concurrent role on the same employment."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:characterizes gmeow:employmentRole ;
    logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty ;
    logic:formalizes gmeow:employmentRole ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use when the native coherence gate must enforce that gmeow:employmentRole names exactly one value; this record is the canonical carrier the gate joins, so the obligation is reasoned rather than restated on a shape surface."@x-gmeow-english ;
